    "source_text": "To a stirred solution of 6-chloronicotinamide (0.053 g, 0.34 mmol), 2,2'-bis(diphenylphosphino)-1,1'-binaphthyl (0.021 g, 0.03 mmol), sodium 2-methylpropan-2-olate (0.065 g, 0.68 mmol) and diacetoxypalladium (7.60 mg, 0.03 mmol) in DME (1 mL) was added (4-(trifluoromethyl)phenyl)methanamine (0.097 mL, 0.68 mmol). The reaction was run in microwave at 100 °C for 4h. The compound was purified by preparative HPLC on a Kromasil C8 column (10 µm 250x20 ID mm) using a gradient of 51-55% acetonitrile in H2O/ACN/FA 95/5/0.2 buffer, over 25 minutes with a flow of 19 mL/min. The compounds were detected by UV at 270nm.  6-(4-(trifluoromethyl)benzylamino)nicotinamide (7.40 mg, 7.40 %) was obtained.  ",
    "text_sha256": "932e8b380a0582c7d6dc6ba878648d225f693f87a1395cf38f4dff7b337f7835",
